1049| Its airborne mass is 25.698 kilograms (NR-008, NR-018).
1050| Its window-minimum factor of safety is 14.972 (NR-009).
1051| All checked TRPT rings and twist segments operate below their failure boundaries at the final operating point (NR-021, NR-022).
1052| The least segment torque margin is 2.03, at S1 (NR-040).
